    <updated>2026-10-19T01:16:27Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9142187?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>rkalis</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/rkalis</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix: several wallet connection fixes

- Fix Safe EIP5782 batch revoking
- Show login errors on account page
- Fix transaction subcmitted toast for Safe wallets
- Do not show disconnect button on Ledger and Safe connectors
- Use the &amp;quot;Safe transaction hash&amp;quot; for Safe transactions
- Fix chain switch error handling
- Redirect to correct connected chain on Safe or Ledger connectors
- Don&amp;#39;t allow Safe on alternative domains&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
