    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;chore: remove CLAUDE.md in favor of AGENTS.md (#309)

Claude Code reads AGENTS.md when a project has no CLAUDE.md (v2.1.277),
so the CLAUDE.md that only imported @AGENTS.md is no longer needed.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
